    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77591" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντᾰχῆ</span></b>  (with iota, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			22.1666.22
		</span></i>, al.<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>PEleph.</u>
			3.6
		</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>), Adv. of Place, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>everywhere</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				109b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πάντων ἴσον κρατεῖν</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.7
			</span></i>: c. gen. loci, <i>in every part of</i> . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Ἑλλησπόντου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.106
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. . . ἄστεως ζητῶν νιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					1107
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>on every side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.124
			</span></i>; 
