					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					660
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ περιπέτεσθε π. κεχηνότες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Av.</u>
					165
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>in every way</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηλοῖ οὐ κατ᾽ ἓν μοῦνον, ἀλλὰ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.78
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.38
			</span></i>, etc.; 
