				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					364
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π. ἄριστοι ἄνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					918e
